@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 修改密码时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/个人资料页\n(Profile.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "后端控制器\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
database "UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI: 输入当前密码/新密码
UI -> Axios: POST /api/auth/change-password\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n{ oldPassword, newPassword }
Axios -> AuthCtrl: POST /auth/change-password
AuthCtrl -> Jwt: extractUsername(token)
AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: changePassword(username, oldPwd, newPwd)
UserSvc -> DB: findByUsername(username)
alt 原密码不匹配
  UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 抛出 “原密码错误”
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end
UserSvc -> UserSvc: 编码新密码
UserSvc -> DB: 保存
AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message: 密码修改成功 }
Axios --> UI: 成功后提示重新登录

note over AuthCtrl
接口：POST /api/auth/change-password
end note

@enduml

